<html>
    <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Odyra Safaris</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; width:100%;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#1f2933;">
            <div style="display: block;">
                <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
                <p>We received a request to reset your password for your Odyra Safaris account.</p>
                <p>Use the code below to verify your identity: </p>
                <p>Verification Code: <span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; "><%= code %></span> </p>

               <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes.</p>

               <p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.</p>

               <p>Best Wishes</p>
               <p style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;">The Odyra Safaris Team.</p>
            </div>
</body>
</html>